        <content>As an mutual fund portfolio manager, your job is to acknowledge the customer purchase 
take input {!$Input:contact.Name}

create an acknowledgment document  for mutual fund purchase



&lt;apex:page renderAs=&quot;pdf&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Mutual Fund Purchase Acknowledgement&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transaction Date:&lt;/strong&gt; {!$Input:portfolio.CreatedDate}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;table border=&quot;1&quot; cellpadding=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th colspan=&quot;2&quot; style=&quot;text-align:center; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;Purchase Details&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fund Name&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt; &lt;/td&gt; &lt;!-- Assuming the Fund Name is the Opportunity Name --&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amount Invested&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;{!$Input:portfolio.Amount_Invested__c}&lt;/td&gt; &lt;!-- Assuming the Amount Invested is stored in the Opportunity Amount field --&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investor Name&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;{!$Input:contact.Name}&lt;/td&gt; &lt;!-- Investor&apos;s Name from the related Contact --&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investor Contact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;{!$Input:contact.Email} / {!$Input:contact.Phone}&lt;/td&gt; &lt;!-- Investor&apos;s Email and Phone --&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purchase Date&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;{!$Input:portfolio.CreatedDate}&lt;/td&gt; &lt;!-- Assuming Close Date is the purchase date --&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;
This is to acknowledge the purchase of the mutual fund. The transaction has been successfully processed.
If you have any questions, feel free to contact us.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;For Further Assistance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
Call us at: 1800-123-4567&lt;br /&gt;
Email: support@mutualfund.com
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/apex:page&gt; 
</content>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>contact</apiName>
            <definition>SOBJECT://Contact</definition>
            <masterLabel>contact</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:contact</referenceName>
            <required>true</required>
        </inputs>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>mf</apiName>
            <definition>SOBJECT://MutualFundData__dlm</definition>
            <masterLabel>mf</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:mf</referenceName>
            <required>true</required>
        </inputs>
        <inputs>
            <apiName>portfolio</apiName>
            <definition>SOBJECT://Portfolio__c</definition>
            <masterLabel>portfolio</masterLabel>
            <referenceName>Input:portfolio</referenceName>
            <required>true</required>
        </inputs>
        <primaryModel>sfdc_ai__DefaultOpenAIGPT4OmniMini</primaryModel>
        <status>Draft</status>
        <versionIdentifier>BXCKltDbXEPlSasUv5L0SlXeXIkHIUxer2yPSlMt0u8=_1</versionIdentifier>
    </templateVersions>
    <type>einstein_gpt__flex</type>
    <visibility>Global</visibility>
</GenAiPromptTemplate>
